Activity_Location	Character	-	-	Location where performed ​
Unpaid_Paid_Status	Discrete	Character	1=Unpaid, 2=Paid	Was activity paid/unpaid? ​
Enterprise_Type	Discrete	Character	-	Enterprise typology ​
NSC	Character	-	-	NSC variable ​
MULT	Character	-	-	MULT variable ​
Key specifics:

Age is numeric, continuous, min 6, max 118, mean 35.88, width 3, valid/invalid counts noted.

Day of the week is discrete: 1=Monday, ..., 7=Sunday. Distribution is even, categorical codes used.

Categorical/discrete variables use meaningful codes (e.g., Gender, Day of Week, Paid/Unpaid, etc.)
